        "text": "Established on the `cas-certificate` route: an untrusted linear-algebra search (axeyum_cas::telescoping::zeilberger) produced the certificate, and axeyum_cas::telescoping_check verified it with its own shift-ratio derivation, its own fraction arithmetic, and a cross-check of both against exact bignum factorial evaluation of the summand. The checker rejects perturbed certificates -- see the tamper controls in the same test file (P+1, 2P, Q+k, a wrong recurrence constant, a degree bump in a_j, a zeroed recurrence, a certificate re-pointed at a different summand, a clipped summation window, and two wrong closed forms are all rejected).",
